00:00:08.287 --> 00:00:11.370
- What's up you guys, my name is Hal.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.205
- I was very, very eager and
excited to see Wonder Woman,

00:00:30.205 --> 00:00:32.072
I just saw it recently, like two days ago,

00:00:32.072 --> 00:00:33.519
and my mind is blown.

00:00:33.519 --> 00:00:35.871
- It took like a week to get tickets.

00:00:35.871 --> 00:00:38.263
- I could not do anything
that Wonder Woman does.

00:00:38.263 --> 00:00:40.375
- Wonder Woman is...

00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:41.458
She's fierce.

00:00:42.578 --> 00:00:44.194
- I've never tried lassoing
but I've definitely

00:00:44.194 --> 00:00:46.311
done it on the dance floor.

00:00:46.311 --> 00:00:48.179
Like, mimed it out.

00:00:48.179 --> 00:00:49.226
(whip cracks)

00:00:49.226 --> 00:00:50.228
But that's about it.

00:00:50.228 --> 00:00:51.658
