00:01:00.532 --> 00:01:01.530
Cows?

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.790
(sighs)

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.856
- He made it seem like we're just out here

00:01:05.856 --> 00:01:08.939
doing just a regular, smegular thing.

00:01:09.811 --> 00:01:12.542
- Oh, shit, that actually
looks kind of crazy.

00:01:12.542 --> 00:01:14.044
- I can do it probably.

00:01:14.044 --> 00:01:15.666
(laughs)

00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:19.499
(dramatic instrumental music)

00:01:22.289 --> 00:01:24.917
- Oh my god, are you kidding?

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:26.361
