00:01:26.361 --> 00:01:28.743
untangled this for me, at least?

00:01:28.743 --> 00:01:31.441
- Alright, well this looks complicated.

00:01:31.441 --> 00:01:33.770
- I'm so confused.

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:36.098
- This is fucking
impossible, are you kidding?

00:01:36.098 --> 00:01:38.188
What is it even doing?

00:01:38.188 --> 00:01:40.961
- I feel like his hole
is way bigger though.

00:01:40.961 --> 00:01:42.711
- And then he just...

00:01:44.298 --> 00:01:46.230
This is simple.

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:47.063
- Oh.

00:01:48.358 --> 00:01:51.033
I just hooked the damn computer.

00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:52.743
- I don't know how Wonder Woman does this,

00:01:52.743 --> 00:01:55.079
