00:01:55.079 --> 00:01:57.093
- I'm so terrified, this terrifying,

00:01:57.093 --> 00:01:58.663
I don't want to do it anymore.

00:01:58.663 --> 00:02:01.368
(laughs)

00:02:01.368 --> 00:02:03.458
- I've got more shit to handle?

00:02:03.458 --> 00:02:04.635
- Oh no.

00:02:04.635 --> 00:02:06.052
Nope, nope, nope.

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:11.121
(shouts)

00:02:11.121 --> 00:02:12.038
- Yah, yah!

00:02:14.405 --> 00:02:16.607
- Alright, I feel even better about this,

00:02:16.607 --> 00:02:20.840
because I've got my hand
shield, my other shield.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.748
- Fuck you, Al.

00:02:22.748 --> 00:02:24.219
For real.

00:02:24.219 --> 00:02:25.517
- I honestly have no strategy.

00:02:25.517 --> 00:02:28.894
I literally don't know what I'm doing.

00:02:28.894 --> 00:02:30.777
