of energy in 2017, okay?

00:02:35.739 --> 00:02:39.389
(bell dings)
(shouts)

00:02:39.389 --> 00:02:41.292
- I'm pretty sure I did.

00:02:41.292 --> 00:02:42.792
- This is so hard.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:47.696
How do you expect me to
do this with a shield?

00:02:48.605 --> 00:02:51.188
(alarm buzzes)

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.926
(alarm buzzes)

00:02:55.926 --> 00:02:58.593
- Yes, come around, come around!

00:03:00.083 --> 00:03:01.080
Damn it.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.663
(alarm buzzes)

00:03:05.614 --> 00:03:07.667
(alarm dings)

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:08.500
- Bitch.

00:03:09.866 --> 00:03:12.582
That's how you fucking lasso, right?

00:03:12.582 --> 00:03:14.559
- The idea of using this to hurt

00:03:14.559 --> 00:03:18.324
