00:03:37.991 --> 00:03:41.719
I still love Wonder Woman,
but this is not for Katie.

00:03:41.719 --> 00:03:42.862
Not for Katie.

00:03:42.862 --> 00:03:44.106
(whip cracks)

00:03:44.106 --> 00:03:45.609
